{"suttaId":"thag4.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1327,1339],"vripara":"267"},"segments":{"thag4.1:0.4":"Nāgasamālattheragāthā","thag4.1:1.1":"“Alaṅkatā suvasanā, mālinī candanussadā;","thag4.1:1.3":"Majjhe mahāpathe nārī, turiye naccati naṭṭakī.","thag4.1:2.1":"“Piṇḍikāya paviṭṭhohaṃ, gacchanto naṃ udikkhisaṃ;","thag4.1:2.3":"Alaṅkataṃ suvasanaṃ, maccupāsaṃva oḍḍitaṃ.","thag4.1:3.1":"“Tato me manasīkāro, yoniso udapajjatha;","thag4.1:3.3":"Ādīnavo pāturahu, nibbidā samatiṭṭhatha [sampatiṭṭhatha (ka.)].","thag4.1:4.1":"“Tato cittaṃ vimucci me, passa dhammasudhammataṃ;","thag4.1:4.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti.","thag4.1:4.5":"… Nāgasamālo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
